00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:25.629
Stage three. Apply the tourniquet and palpate the vein to identify a suitable site, releasing the tourniquet temporarily if needed. Disinfect the skin with chlorhexidine using a back-and-forth or circular motion and allow it to dry completely - and do not touch the site afterward. Put on sterile gloves to maintain aseptic technique. Then re-apply the tourniquet without contaminating the cleaned site.

